# Code owners for sandbox-forge
#
# The branch protection in .github/branch-protection.json requires one approving
# review before anything lands on main. Without a CODEOWNERS file GitHub has
# nobody to request that review from, so the rule is either satisfied by
# habit or waived by an admin every single time. This file makes the owner the
# default reviewer for every path, and names the areas that carry the product's
# claims separately.
